        80.59070587158203,
        527.4142456054688,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "where the prevalence of HIV is high  and/or the prevalence of isoniazid resistance is high  should  30 31",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
